{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29433","headline":"王十二兄与畏之员外相访见招小饮时予以悼亡日近不去因寄 · 李商隐","name":"王十二兄与畏之员外相访见招小饮时予以悼亡日近不去因寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢傅门庭旧末行，今朝歌管属檀郎。\n更无人处帘垂地，欲拂尘时簟竟牀。\n嵇氏幼男犹可悯，左家娇女岂能忘。\n秋霖腹疾俱难遣，万里西风夜正长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}